=== Codex Diagnostic Shell ===
Type help for commands.

diag> 
Commands:
  help         show this
  info         boot constants
  heap         heap usage
  stack        stack usage
  ticks        timer ticks
  peek <addr>  read 8 bytes (decimal or 0x hex)
  poke <a> <v> write byte at address
  in <port>    read I/O port
  out <p> <v>  write I/O port
  echo <text>  echo back
  exit         halt
diag> 
hello
diag> 
halting.
